                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "casual platformer where you draw springs and avoid obstacles with your mouse\n\n✅Interesting sketchbook-style graphics\n✅The game has many levels\n✅Good value for the game's content\n✅Levels become increasingly difficult, and levels gradually teach new mechanics and increase the challenge\n✅Educational elements include photos and names of places from different countries\n\n❌Inappropriate music\n❌Many repetitive levels\n❌Little variety of obstacles\n\n✅✅ Verdict: [strike] Terrible [/strike], [strike] Bad [/strike], [strike] Mediocre [/strike], [strike] Decent [/strike], [b] Good [/b], [strike] Very Good [/strike] (Rating scale for tested game)\n\n[quote] If you'd like to see more of my reviews, you can find them on my\ncurator page:\n[url=https://store.steampowered.com/curator/45994324/admin/reviews_manage/]CuratorKingViking[/url]\nand on my group:\n[url=https://steamcommunity.com/groups/CuratorKingViking]GroupKingViking[/url]\n\nIf you have any questions about my reviews, feel free to ask.\nI'm happy to answer them. All reviews are my own!!\nBest regards, King Viking Bezimienny, Polish Game Reviewer. [/quote]",
